      "statement_scope": "Theorem1.2 with the explicit simplifying Assumption3.6: isotropic absolutely almost-simple algebraic Q-group and any arithmetic subgroup Gamma. Bounded generation has exactly Definition1.1 scope: fixed r,C, finite exceptional Gamma_0 and finitely many standard connected Q-rank-one root subgroups, with each factor either exceptional or lying in a subgroup intersection and satisfying the stated logarithmic norm bound. No SL(n,Z)-specific n^2-n count, arbitrary S-arithmetic or infinite-center assertion is added.",
